WEBVTT

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.870
A tad bit more and we'll be at
the Blue Dragon's ruins, maro.

00:01:52.633 --> 00:01:53.633
Umm...

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:54.570
What is it?

00:01:55.233 --> 00:01:56.533
Before we go to the ruins,

00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:58.796
is it okay if we go check out
how things are in Talta Village?

00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:00.403
That's fine.

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:14.403
The buildings that were destroyed
have mostly been repaired, huh?

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:15.470
Yeah.

00:02:16.366 --> 00:02:17.026
Oh!

00:02:21.033 --> 00:02:23.103
I know. Let's try going there!

00:02:23.366 --> 00:02:24.026
- Right!
- Right!

00:02:25.333 --> 00:02:27.073
They look well.

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.100
Yeah, they do.

00:02:28.466 --> 00:02:30.066
The village is safe. Let's go.

00:02:32.433 --> 00:02:33.833
You're not going to see anyone?

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:40.070
What am I supposed to say to them?
Nene is still doing terrible things.

00:02:40.466 --> 00:02:42.996
We have to solve the mystery
of the ruins and get stronger!

00:02:44.066 --> 00:02:48.966
THE DARK DRAGON

00:02:49.866 --> 00:02:51.526
The soldier who protects the west,

00:02:51.566 --> 00:02:54.566
emerges from the forest
with a quiet eye behind him,

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.200
and arrives at the land.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.670
A crimson light,
at the time of silence,

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.800
a new Shadow is born from
the guardian of the sky and shows the way.

00:03:04.366 --> 00:03:10.426
The soldier lost in darkness finds the answer
in the space between truth and lies...

00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:13.633
Hmm. I still don't get it, maro.

00:03:13.733 --> 00:03:15.333
The answer lies inside.

00:03:25.733 --> 00:03:27.303
The soldier who protects the west,

00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:30.233
emerges from the forest
with a quiet eye behind him,

00:03:30.266 --> 00:03:31.826
and arrives at the land.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.300
The mural seems to match, but...

00:03:40.433 --> 00:03:42.803
Just as we thought,
there's a relief of forest inside.

00:03:47.466 --> 00:03:50.126
We emerged from the forest
and arrived at the land, but...

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.800
There's nothing here, maro.

00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:54.433
A crimson light,
at the time of silence,

00:03:54.466 --> 00:03:58.396
a new Shadow is born from
the guardian of the sky and shows the way.

00:03:58.833 --> 00:04:00.973
There should be a path somewhere
beyond this point.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.200
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:03.533 --> 00:04:04.533
Wow...

00:04:04.966 --> 00:04:06.766
I've been here many times,

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.200
but I never knew there
was a room like this.

00:04:09.433 --> 00:04:10.433
Yeah.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.100
Zola discovered it.

00:04:12.333 --> 00:04:17.073
Shu, these are Blue Dragon's ruins.
You check it out yourself.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:17.870
Right.

00:04:19.566 --> 00:04:20.226
What is it?

00:04:20.566 --> 00:04:23.026
Well, I don't know what I should do.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:25.100
Why don't you try touching the wall?

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:26.370
Okay.

00:04:29.433 --> 00:04:31.733
Maybe you need to push it harder.

00:04:39.633 --> 00:04:42.033
Try knocking it with your head, maro.

00:04:44.266 --> 00:04:45.926
Oww!

00:04:45.966 --> 00:04:48.096
Quit fooling around and
summon your Shadow.

00:04:48.433 --> 00:04:49.103
My Shadow?

00:04:49.433 --> 00:04:50.803
These are Blue Dragon's ruins.

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:52.870
He might respond to this place.

00:04:54.966 --> 00:04:55.626
Alright.

00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:08.066
Let me say this.
I don't know anything.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.670
Try touching the wall, Blue Dragon.

00:05:14.966 --> 00:05:15.626
Try pushing.

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:21.270
Hit it with your head!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.470
Ow...

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.570
What're you two doing?

00:05:27.966 --> 00:05:29.426
Why don't we check out the place, too?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.430
There's nothing unusual, maro.

00:05:37.833 --> 00:05:39.703
No clues at all.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:44.470
Damn it! Come on, we can't defeat
Nene without more power!

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:48.330
A crimson light,
at the time of silence, huh?

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.470
Let's try this at a different time.

00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:57.566
A crimson light,
at the time of silence,

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:01.830
a new Shadow is born from
the guardian of the sky and shows the way.

00:06:03.433 --> 00:06:05.403
Shu, try standing in the entrance.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:06.770
Over there?

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:29.270
A new Shadow is born from
the guardian of the sky and shows the way?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:37.670
Huh?

00:06:39.733 --> 00:06:40.403
Shu?

00:06:41.866 --> 00:06:42.526
Shu!

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.070
The same thing happened
with you, Kluke.

00:06:45.333 --> 00:06:46.003
Huh?

00:06:46.133 --> 00:06:47.303
The Shadow ruins...

00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:49.533
Only the Wielder of the Shadow
that belongs to the ruins

00:06:49.566 --> 00:06:51.566
can enter the deepest part
of the ruins.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.170
It's dark.

00:07:04.966 --> 00:07:06.726
Hey!

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:14.766
Blue Dragon.

00:07:18.733 --> 00:07:20.603
Blue Dragon! What's wrong?!

00:07:23.966 --> 00:07:24.626
Damn it...

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:35.170
When is Shu coming back, maro?

00:07:35.466 --> 00:07:39.166
Maybe after he's gotten
some kind of new power.

00:07:39.433 --> 00:07:40.433
How will he do that?

00:07:41.133 --> 00:07:42.133
Who knows?

00:07:42.666 --> 00:07:47.926
The soldier lost in darkness finds the answer
in the space between truth and lies...

00:07:48.566 --> 00:07:50.296
That's the last part of the text.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.430
I'm very concerned.

00:07:52.466 --> 00:07:53.466
Why?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.270
"Finds the answer," it says.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.430
But there's no way Shu
will find the answer.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.800
He doesn't think much.

00:08:00.533 --> 00:08:01.603
True.

00:08:01.633 --> 00:08:02.633
It's concerning.

00:08:05.233 --> 00:08:06.773
How long should I keep going?

00:08:07.566 --> 00:08:09.166
How far should I go?

00:08:11.566 --> 00:08:12.766
Blue Dragon!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.630
Why won't you appear?!

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:20.570
Darkness does not
produce light or shadow.

00:08:21.233 --> 00:08:24.433
Shadow produces light.
Light produces new shadows.

00:08:30.666 --> 00:08:31.996
Who're you?

00:08:32.833 --> 00:08:33.973
Shadow Wielder...

00:08:34.066 --> 00:08:34.726
Huh?

00:08:34.833 --> 00:08:37.003
Excessive power produces darkness.

00:08:37.033 --> 00:08:37.703
Darkness?

00:08:37.866 --> 00:08:40.326
Darkness swallows up
light and shadow.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.300
What're you talking about?

00:08:43.466 --> 00:08:46.926
If you take the wrong path,
you will lose your Shadow.

00:08:47.266 --> 00:08:51.326
I came here because I want power.
I don't intend on failing!

00:09:16.033 --> 00:09:16.703
That's...

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:24.900
Is that me?

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.630
Blue Dragon.

00:09:27.066 --> 00:09:28.326
Why is this thing here?

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:29.870
Do you know something?

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:30.570
I don't.

00:09:32.066 --> 00:09:33.066
Let's check it out.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.070
Nothing special here.

00:09:48.133 --> 00:09:50.273
What's the plan? Shall I smash it?

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.130
Hold it, hold it, hold it!

00:09:52.466 --> 00:09:54.926
We're not done checking it all out.

00:09:55.833 --> 00:09:58.533
I wonder if there's some
kind of clue written on it.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.330
Can you read it if there is one?

00:10:05.966 --> 00:10:07.566
I wonder what that hole is for.

00:10:10.033 --> 00:10:11.033
There's nothing here.

00:10:15.066 --> 00:10:17.696
Blue Dragon.
Can you remove that shiny stone?

00:10:21.766 --> 00:10:23.996
Try putting it into that hole.

00:10:27.233 --> 00:10:28.233
How's that?

00:10:35.933 --> 00:10:36.933
Light...

00:10:41.666 --> 00:10:42.666
A Shadow?!

00:11:07.766 --> 00:11:08.866
Who're you?!

00:11:09.366 --> 00:11:12.166
I'm Blue Dragon.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:15.870
Knock it off! I'm Blue Dragon!

00:11:16.366 --> 00:11:19.926
I'm the true Blue Dragon.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:23.270
The true Blue Dragon?
You sure say interesting stuff.

00:11:23.833 --> 00:11:25.633
Then what am I?

00:11:26.066 --> 00:11:28.196
You're the Shadow Blue Dragon.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.370
You're a Shadow, too!

00:11:31.566 --> 00:11:33.966
There's something I have that you don't.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.170
That's why you're a hollow Shadow.

00:11:38.633 --> 00:11:40.373
What is it that I don't have?!

00:11:40.633 --> 00:11:43.173
You're a Shadow because
you don't know what that is.

00:11:43.333 --> 00:11:46.303
Drop the nonsense, you jerk!

00:11:46.333 --> 00:11:47.773
Hold it, Blue Dragon.

00:11:48.333 --> 00:11:51.533
In the Extra Seven of
the Book of the Beginning,

00:11:51.566 --> 00:11:54.126
it says there's power
sealed up in here.

00:11:55.366 --> 00:11:58.826
I am that sealed power.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:03.500
Then... Then could you
give me that power?

00:12:04.266 --> 00:12:06.126
What do you need power for?

00:12:06.533 --> 00:12:08.403
There's an outrageously
powerful enemy.

00:12:10.733 --> 00:12:14.503
I need power in order to defeat Nene.

00:12:14.933 --> 00:12:18.173
The power you desire
produces darkness.

00:12:18.833 --> 00:12:19.503
Darkness?

00:12:20.666 --> 00:12:22.966
Excessive power
produces darkness...

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.270
What's all this about darkness?

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:28.970
Darkness swallows up
light and shadow.

00:12:29.666 --> 00:12:31.466
I must not give it to you.

00:12:31.933 --> 00:12:32.973
No way...

00:12:33.333 --> 00:12:36.073
Shu, talking won't work with this guy!

00:12:36.666 --> 00:12:39.366
If I pound him into the ground,
it proves that I'm more powerful.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:40.570
End of story!

00:12:40.833 --> 00:12:47.773
Shadow Blue Dragon, do you think
you can defeat me, the true Blue Dragon?

00:12:48.066 --> 00:12:51.466
Enough with the shadow
and true stuff!

00:12:53.666 --> 00:12:54.666
You little...

00:12:57.966 --> 00:12:58.966
You!

00:12:59.166 --> 00:13:00.226
Shu!

00:13:00.766 --> 00:13:03.466
You don't have enough fighting spirit!
Do you want to lose?!

00:13:03.566 --> 00:13:04.566
Got it!

00:13:28.866 --> 00:13:30.026
Blue Dragon!

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.000
You!

00:13:35.933 --> 00:13:37.373
Don't tell me...

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:43.830
Blue Dragon!

00:13:44.233 --> 00:13:45.903
Shu! Remove the stone!

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.770
That glowing stone!

00:13:50.066 --> 00:13:51.596
Erase his shadow!

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:59.900
Remove it! Remove that stone!

00:14:01.833 --> 00:14:03.273
No! Stop!

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:04.730
Hurry!

00:14:18.833 --> 00:14:19.833
Blue Dragon!

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:25.400
It's over, Shu.

00:14:25.733 --> 00:14:26.403
What?

00:14:26.633 --> 00:14:28.173
I said it's over.

00:14:28.866 --> 00:14:33.326
Thanks to you removing that stone,
he disappeared.

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:38.670
Great amount of power started
flowing into me before he vanished.

00:14:39.566 --> 00:14:42.266
I've been given new power.

00:14:42.566 --> 00:14:43.566
Really?!

00:14:43.633 --> 00:14:45.473
That's right. Look.

00:14:47.766 --> 00:14:49.796
I can see the way now.

00:14:54.533 --> 00:14:55.533
Everyone!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:59.000
Let's go, Shu.
We can return from there.

00:14:59.233 --> 00:14:59.903
Right!

00:15:01.266 --> 00:15:03.926
Shu! You idiot!

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:08.930
That's not me.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.370
Pick up on it already!

00:15:11.666 --> 00:15:12.666
Shu!

00:15:17.666 --> 00:15:20.026
What else can you do now?

00:15:20.333 --> 00:15:23.103
All sorts of things, Shu. All sorts.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:27.470
Don't you get it, Shu?!
He's a fake!

00:15:29.266 --> 00:15:31.366
I wonder if Shu's okay.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:32.600
I don't know.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:34.100
What do you mean?

00:15:34.766 --> 00:15:39.266
I don't know what kind of answer the ruins
will give to those who desire power...

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:40.970
The ruins will answer?

00:15:41.266 --> 00:15:43.426
It's all up to Shu.

00:15:45.933 --> 00:15:48.073
Everyone's waiting for us.

00:15:48.366 --> 00:15:52.466
Of course they are.
They're relying on our power.

00:15:56.633 --> 00:15:57.633
It's a wall...

00:15:57.966 --> 00:16:00.296
Now, let us cross through it.

00:16:01.233 --> 00:16:02.733
And then we can get back.

00:16:03.333 --> 00:16:06.373
Wait, Shu! Are you going to
leave me behind?!

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.030
How do we get through?

00:16:08.266 --> 00:16:10.426
This is a type of door.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:11.670
You jerk!

00:16:11.833 --> 00:16:14.403
I'm sure there's a way to open it.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.500
Stop!

00:16:15.533 --> 00:16:17.203
Look, right there...

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:18.670
One, two!

00:16:20.066 --> 00:16:21.366
Oww!

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.130
Why do something so stupid?

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:23.870
Huh?

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.400
You try it, too.

00:16:26.466 --> 00:16:27.626
Not a chance.

00:16:27.966 --> 00:16:29.696
There's a depression on that wall.

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:33.470
The door should open
if you put your hand in there.

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:37.530
Right. Try putting your hand in there.

00:16:39.266 --> 00:16:40.266
No!

00:16:40.666 --> 00:16:42.766
I can tell, Shu!

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:46.470
If you go outside now like this,
you'll lose your Shadow...

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:53.130
You'll lose me! I'll be confined here...
in this darkness!

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:58.100
Shu!

00:17:02.033 --> 00:17:03.073
What's the matter?

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.630
Something's not right...

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:08.770
Blue Dragon, why are you so calm?

00:17:09.233 --> 00:17:10.403
What do you mean?

00:17:10.533 --> 00:17:13.203
You're usually rougher.

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.170
Like you're always
angry at something.

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:17.830
What is that "something"?

00:17:18.033 --> 00:17:24.973
I don't know what it is.
But I thought your power came from rage.

00:17:25.733 --> 00:17:26.403
Shu...

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:30.700
I don't feel the anger that
I usually feel from you right now.

00:17:32.033 --> 00:17:33.073
Who are you?

00:17:34.133 --> 00:17:35.803
Where's Blue Dragon?

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:38.370
I'm Blue Dragon.

00:17:38.633 --> 00:17:40.973
You're not my Blue Dragon.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:49.330
Anger brings darkness.

00:17:49.466 --> 00:17:50.466
You?!

00:17:50.966 --> 00:17:52.826
Darkness swallows up shadow...

00:17:52.866 --> 00:17:53.866
Damn it!

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:57.000
Where are you, Blue Dragon?!

00:17:57.933 --> 00:18:00.873
The Shadow of darkness swallows up
the Shadow Wielder as well!

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:07.030
Shu!

00:18:07.066 --> 00:18:08.096
Blue Dragon!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.600
Die!

00:18:10.666 --> 00:18:12.996
Come, Blue Dragon!

00:18:23.833 --> 00:18:25.333
How dare you!

00:18:26.633 --> 00:18:28.533
Fire Crisis!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.870
Crushing Nail!

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:44.200
It's useless.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:48.700
I have all the power you have
plus the power you don't have.

00:18:48.833 --> 00:18:49.873
Damn it!

00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:55.133
You!

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.600
You can't beat me.

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:03.030
Blue Dragon!

00:19:03.733 --> 00:19:04.773
Damn it!

00:19:10.266 --> 00:19:12.426
Go!

00:19:15.433 --> 00:19:17.433
Darkness is the power of destruction.

00:19:22.366 --> 00:19:26.796
Shadow Wielder who produces darkness...
You will fade away inside of these ruins.

00:19:27.066 --> 00:19:30.326
That is the destiny of those
who desire too much power.

00:19:34.133 --> 00:19:35.603
Shut up!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.370
Too much power, my ass!

00:19:38.733 --> 00:19:44.233
There's a guy outside even more powerful
doing terrible things! We have to go!

00:19:45.433 --> 00:19:48.673
We have to become more powerful!

00:19:49.266 --> 00:19:52.626
Blue Dragon! Are you going to let
this guy do as he likes forever?!

00:19:52.866 --> 00:19:57.326
Shut up, Shu!
Then give me more power!

00:20:07.833 --> 00:20:09.573
W-Why?!

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:16.700
Go!

00:20:26.866 --> 00:20:28.526
Shadow beats darkness?!

00:20:40.433 --> 00:20:42.533
I knew I'd win.

00:20:51.866 --> 00:20:52.996
What's this thing?

00:20:53.333 --> 00:20:54.333
A mummy?!

00:20:54.733 --> 00:20:55.433
Who's?

00:20:55.966 --> 00:20:57.526
It doesn't matter who it is.

00:20:58.633 --> 00:21:00.173
Our business here is finished.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:00.870
Oh...

00:21:01.266 --> 00:21:02.566
The door's gone!

00:21:03.166 --> 00:21:05.796
The door may have
been a deception of his.

00:21:06.433 --> 00:21:09.073
But how can we get out?

00:21:09.466 --> 00:21:12.326
Isn't there a good way, Blue Dragon?

00:21:13.966 --> 00:21:15.466
What I can do...

00:21:16.866 --> 00:21:18.326
...is this!

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:27.000
Let's go, Shu.

00:21:27.233 --> 00:21:27.903
Right!

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:35.030
W-What?

00:21:35.066 --> 00:21:36.066
An earthquake?

00:21:36.233 --> 00:21:37.533
Get outside, everyone!

00:21:47.566 --> 00:21:48.226
Shu?!

00:21:56.666 --> 00:21:58.026
Blue Dragon!

00:22:00.533 --> 00:22:01.533
- Shu!
- Shu!

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:02.600
I'm back!

00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:05.770
How did it go?

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:08.200
Great!

00:22:08.433 --> 00:22:09.673
So you got more power?

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:11.100
Really?

00:22:11.166 --> 00:22:12.166
Really.

00:22:12.766 --> 00:22:13.426
Right?

00:22:13.566 --> 00:22:16.866
Yeah! I'm definitely
more powerful than before.

00:22:19.133 --> 00:22:20.273
There!

00:22:21.766 --> 00:22:23.496
Alright. Me, too!

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:27.900
There! How about that?!

00:22:35.666 --> 00:22:36.666
For real?

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:39.630
- Oww...
- Oww...

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:42.100
Yeah, for real!

00:24:18.066 --> 00:24:22.396
With his Mighty Quarter, Szabo appears
before Jiro, who is still haunted by his past.

00:24:22.500 --> 00:24:24.730
Jiro, why didn't you call me for this?

00:24:24.766 --> 00:24:27.766
I can take them on by myself.
Beat it.

00:24:27.800 --> 00:24:30.730
But it's been a while since
I got to check out robots in action!

00:24:30.766 --> 00:24:32.796
You're not here to root for me?

00:24:33.233 --> 00:24:35.673
Next on Blue Dragon:
The Powerful One
